# INPUT-ROW-LIMIT: PgDn at 41 rows in two menus whose rows fx and xfx list
# alike: /model over thirty language models (a page is 19 of them), and
# /effort's five levels, which a page wraps by `@mod`
# (effort_menu.zig:53-57@481104fd): 19 is four on, 20 would be where it
# began. The page is inputRowLimit(content_bottom)
# (input_completion_runtime.zig:222-233@481104fd).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-row-limit-models.json
seed p5-effort-fork-seed-astra.json
nomodel
wait 3
xfx: wait 3
type /model
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap model
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap model-pgdn
key Escape
wait 0.7
type /effort
key Enter
wait 1
snap effort
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap effort-pgdn
